# Provenance of amity-uikit-design-tokens.json
#
# Source of truth is cleverden, not another platform. The table and the Dart
# token model are both emitted there and pushed here by a sync script:
#
#   cd <cleverden>
#   node scripts/uikit-build-token-model.mjs        # regenerates the four models
#   node scripts/sync-flutter-tokens.mjs            # dry-run: what would change
#   node scripts/sync-flutter-tokens.mjs --apply    # write
#
#   AMITY_FLUTTER_UIKIT=<path to this repo> is needed unless the script's
#   default checkout path happens to be yours.
#
# Do NOT copy these from the Android repo. That is what this file used to
# record, and it was the wrong shape even though every value was right: Android
# is a consumer of the same generator, so vendoring from it made a consumer the
# de-facto source. A token change reached Android by running a script and
# reached Flutter only if somebody remembered. The Dart emit and the sync script
# remove the detour (cleverden 06c6161f, 2026-08-11).
#
# kAmityThemeDefaults is derived by the sync from the config that actually
# lands here — post-merge — so app-only theme keys survive. Deriving it from
# the source-of-truth config instead would silently drop toast_background_color,
# and nothing would notice until a host shipped a stale config and backfilled
# into the hole.
#
# sha256 of the vendored table, to check the copy without any other repo:
#   0bf676635310c4f3...  (shasum -a 256 assets/tokens/amity-uikit-design-tokens.json)

